codelists (similar to test code/name pairs).

These can be CDISC or Sponsor specified<y:LabelModel><y:SmartNodeLabelModel distance="4.0"/></y:LabelModel><y:ModelParameter><y:SmartNodeLabelModelParameter labelRatioX="0.4963468336854513" labelRatioY="-0.5" nodeRatioX="0.5" nodeRatioY="-0.5" offsetX="0.0" offsetY="4.0" upX="0.0" upY="-1.0"/></y:ModelParameter></y:NodeLabel>
